 "archetype": "machine.arcade-cabinet",
 "description": "A classic upright arcade cabinet (a Midway Pac-Man is 1.73 x 0.64 x 0.86 m): plywood side panels with the stepped profile, side art and chrome T-molding, a lit marquee, a tilted monitor behind a black bezel with a maze game on screen and a speaker grille, a control panel with one or two joysticks (pivot at the base), fire and start buttons, and a coin door hinged on its left edge with coin mechanisms, reject buttons and a return cup; a service door and vents at the back. Three colour schemes. Faces +Z, stands on y = 0.",
